    "body": "I think it's reasonable to add this, though I vaguely recall browsers maybe getting rid of this again? In Firefox it's only supported if you're not using HTTPS for instance, as things stand today: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1596935. Which makes it kinda pointless. (Note that MDN doesn't really determine what is legal.)",
