    "body": "Please forgive my lax terminology.  It looks to me that the value is currently supported in two mainstream browsers.\r\n\r\n* https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/search?q=x-dns-prefetch-control&path=\r\n* https://github.com/chromium/chromium/search?q=x-dns-prefetch-control\r\n\r\nAs the spec is meant to reflect reality, I think it should be included.",
