    "updated_at": "2020-12-07T15:56:47Z",
    "body": "But, is it supported interoperably? Adding a meta value isn't just done to appease validators; it also needs to come with an interoperable processing model, and ideally web platform tests. (Which might not be possible in this case, I dunno.) If it's only supported in HTTPS in one browser, and in both HTTP and HTTPS in another, then that's quite interesting...\r\n\r\nI'll ask around to see what Chrome folks think.",
